# Skills

| Skills | Test automation: web UI, REST API, BDD; exposure to unit and performance testing. Functional, exploratory, regression, end-to-end, integration, security and accessibility testing. Defect and test case management. |
|---|---|
| Testing tools | VS Code, Azure DevOps, Azure Portal, Atlassian Jira, Confluence, GitLab, Jenkins, browser developer tools, Playwright/TypeScript, Postman, DBeaver, TestComplete, pytest; familiar with Cypress.io. |
| AI | Prompt engineering, basic and advanced techniques. GitHub Copilot (Copilot Skills development, copilot-instructions.md, AI-powered PR review agent), ChatGPT, Claude, Google AI Studio, Cline. |
| Languages | JavaScript, TypeScript, Python; familiar with HTML, CSS, SQL. |
| Other tools | Git, GitHub, Unix command line, Microsoft package, SharePoint, Power Automate, WordPress, Figma, HubSpot, VPN. Familiar with Power BI, Databricks, Microsoft D365, AWS. |

